  "subject": "情报学研究科_数理工学",
  "text": "求函数 $\\dfrac{1}{x^4-1}$ 的原函数。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "有理函数积分",
    "部分分式分解",
    "反正切函数积分",
    "对数函数积分"
  ],
  "question_type": "不定积分计算",
  "method": [
    "因式分解$x^4-1=(x^2-1)(x^2+1)$",
    "对$x^2$做部分分式分解",
    "再对$1/(x^2-1)$做部分分式分解"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "分解 $x^4-1=(x^2-1)(x^2+1)$",
    "设 $\\dfrac{1}{(x^2-1)(x^2+1)}=\\dfrac{A}{x^2-1}+\\dfrac{B}{x^2+1}$，求出 $A=1/2,B=-1/2$",
    "对 $1/(x^2-1)$ 再分解为 $\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{x-1}-\\dfrac{1}{x+1}\\right)$",
    "逐项积分并合并结果"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "rational_function_integral",
    "template": "\\int \\dfrac{1}{x^4-1}\\,dx",
    "variable_count": 0
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "原函数",
      "steps": [
        "先将 $\\dfrac{1}{x^4-1}=\\dfrac{1}{(x^2-1)(x^2+1)}$ 按 $x^2$ 部分分式：设 $\\dfrac{1}{(x^2-1)(x^2+1)}=\\dfrac{A}{x^2-1}+\\dfrac{B}{x^2+1}$，通分得 $A(x^2+1)+B(x^2-1)=1$；令 $x^2=1$ 得 $2A=1\\Rightarrow A=1/2$；令 $x^2=-1$ 得 $-2B=1\\Rightarrow B=-1/2$",
        "于是 $\\dfrac{1}{x^4-1}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{x^2-1}-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{x^2+1}$；再将 $\\dfrac{1}{x^2-1}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{x-1}-\\dfrac{1}{x+1}\\right)$代入，得 $\\dfrac{1}{x^4-1}=\\dfrac{1}{4}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{x-1}-\\dfrac{1}{x+1}\\right)-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{x^2+1}$",
        "逐项积分：$\\int\\dfrac{1}{x-1}dx=\\ln|x-1|$，$\\int\\dfrac{1}{x+1}dx=\\ln|x+1|$，$\\int\\dfrac{1}{x^2+1}dx=\\arctan x$",
        "合并得原函数：$\\dfrac{1}{4}\\ln\\left|\\dfrac{x-1}{x+1}\\right|-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\arctan x+C$。验算：对结果求导，$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\dfrac14\\ln|x-1|-\\dfrac14\\ln|x+1|-\\dfrac12\\arctan x\\right]=\\dfrac{1}{4(x-1)}-\\dfrac{1}{4(x+1)}-\\dfrac{1}{2(x^2+1)}=\\dfrac{1}{2(x^2-1)}-\\dfrac{1}{2(x^2+1)}=\\dfrac{(x^2+1)-(x^2-1)}{2(x^4-1)}=\\dfrac{2}{2(x^4-1)}=\\dfrac{1}{x^4-1}$，与被积函数一致，验证正确"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
    {
      "text": "求 $\\displaystyle\\int \\dfrac{1}{x^2-1}\\,dx$。",
