    {
      "text": "求 $\\displaystyle\\int \\dfrac{1}{x^4-16}\\,dx$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "有理函数积分",
        "因式分解",
        "部分分式分解"
      ],
      "question_type": "不定积分计算",
      "method": [
        "因式分解$x^4-16=(x^2-4)(x^2+4)$，类比原题方法"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "分解$x^4-16=(x-2)(x+2)(x^2+4)$",
        "按$x^2$做部分分式",
        "对$1/(x^2-4)$继续分解",
        "逐项积分"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "rational_function_integral_generalized",
        "template": "\\int\\dfrac{1}{x^4-16}dx",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "设 $\\dfrac{1}{(x^2-4)(x^2+4)}=\\dfrac{A}{x^2-4}+\\dfrac{B}{x^2+4}$，得 $A(x^2+4)+B(x^2-4)=1$；令$x^2=4$得$8A=1\\Rightarrow A=1/8$；令$x^2=-4$得$-8B=1\\Rightarrow B=-1/8$",
            "再分解 $\\dfrac{1}{x^2-4}=\\dfrac{1}{4}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{x-2}-\\dfrac{1}{x+2}\\right)$，故 $\\dfrac{1}{x^4-16}=\\dfrac{1}{32}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{x-2}-\\dfrac{1}{x+2}\\right)-\\dfrac{1}{8}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{x^2+4}$",
            "对最后一项，$\\int\\dfrac{1}{x^2+4}dx=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\arctan\\dfrac{x}{2}$",
            "合并得：$\\dfrac{1}{32}\\ln\\left|\\dfrac{x-2}{x+2}\\right|-\\dfrac{1}{16}\\arctan\\dfrac{x}{2}+C$；求导验算可确认结果正确"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kyoto-2024-a19745fad7-q02-practice-03",
