    },
    {
      "text": "利用与原题相同方法，求 $\\displaystyle\\int\\dfrac{1}{x^4-1}\\,dx$ 在区间 $[2,3]$ 上的定积分值（保留 $\\ln$ 和 $\\arctan$ 形式）。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "定积分计算",
        "原函数代入"
      ],
      "question_type": "定积分计算",
      "method": [
        "利用原题求得的原函数代入端点"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "写出原函数",
        "代入上下限相减"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "definite_integral_from_antiderivative",
        "template": "\\int_2^3 \\dfrac{1}{x^4-1}dx",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "原函数为 $F(x)=\\dfrac14\\ln\\left|\\dfrac{x-1}{x+1}\\right|-\\dfrac12\\arctan x$（原题已求得）",
            "$F(3)=\\dfrac14\\ln\\dfrac24-\\dfrac12\\arctan3=\\dfrac14\\ln\\dfrac12-\\dfrac12\\arctan3=-\\dfrac14\\ln2-\\dfrac12\\arctan3$",
            "$F(2)=\\dfrac14\\ln\\dfrac13-\\dfrac12\\arctan2=-\\dfrac14\\ln3-\\dfrac12\\arctan2$",
            "定积分 $=F(3)-F(2)=-\\dfrac14\\ln2+\\dfrac14\\ln3-\\dfrac12\\arctan3+\\dfrac12\\arctan2=\\dfrac14\\ln\\dfrac32+\\dfrac12(\\arctan2-\\arctan3)$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kyoto-2024-a19745fad7-q02-practice-04",
      "school": "京都大学",
      "year": "2024"
    }
